# Corrections

<p>We correct errors publicly, date every correction, and link the source.</p>

{% if (corrections | length) == 0 %}
<p><em>No corrections yet.</em> Spot an error? <a href="mailto:contact@theaustinbulletin.com">Tell us</a>.</p>
{% else %}
<section class="corrections-list">
  {% for c in corrections | sort(attribute='date') | reverse %}
  <article class="correction">
    <h3><time datetime="{{ c.date | isoDate }}">{{ c.date | longDate }}</time></h3>
    <p><strong>Page:</strong> <a href="{{ c.url | escape }}">{{ c.url | escape }}</a></p>
    <p><strong>What was wrong:</strong> {{ c.wrong | escape }}</p>
    <p><strong>What it says now:</strong> {{ c.now | escape }}</p>
    <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="{{ c.source | escape }}">{{ c.source | escape }}</a></p>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
  </section>
{% endif %}

